WEBVTT

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:31.997
so I think our demographics
have played to our advantage.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:35.163
I think what has also helped us a lot

00:08:35.163 --> 00:08:40.163
is that unlike the rigidity
of standard of care protocols

00:08:40.197 --> 00:08:43.263
in many advanced parts of the world,

00:08:43.263 --> 00:08:48.430
I think Indian doctors are very ready
to experiment with therapies

00:08:48.463 --> 00:08:49.663
that can work.

00:08:49.697 --> 00:08:51.663
Now, for instance, this is a new virus.

00:08:51.697 --> 00:08:53.397
This was a new disease.

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:58.497
And if you are very stuck
on standard of care protocols,

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:00.697
which may not work for this disease,